cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  HDD Price Index — cheapest new internal 3.5" SATA HDD
  price per terabyte (USD/TB), Amazon US
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: HDDHunt
    website: 'https://hddhunt.com/'
abstract: >-
  An open, daily-refreshed dataset tracking the cheapest new,
  internal 3.5" SATA hard-drive price per terabyte (USD/TB) at
  each capacity tier (4–24 TB) on Amazon.com (US), with an
  append-only daily time series of the full per-tier $/TB curve.
  Machine-readable companion to the live index at
  https://hddhunt.com/cheapest-hdd-per-tb/.
url: 'https://hddhunt.com/cheapest-hdd-per-tb/'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/AdamDudley/hddhunt-price-index'
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - hard drive
  - HDD
  - price per terabyte
  - USD per TB
  - storage economics
  - data hoarding
  - homelab
  - NAS
  - Amazon US
  - price index
  - time series
  - open data
